{"id":135915557,"slug":"i-aint-saying-its-a-grave-digger","title":"I Ain't Saying It's A Grave Digger, But In Ain't Messing With No Broke Papers","subtitle":"My prediction about the utility of not reading the whole article comes true, again.","post_date":"2023-08-11T10:30:16.041Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/i-aint-saying-its-a-grave-digger","wordcount":308,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:57:43.448Z","body_sha256":"5e6cb5c435a33226f5506f8fe097c7247e4f815b748537c5061d06553ce8c79c","text_words":333,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>I had someone ask me to look at their data on <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC5215795/\">Photobiomodulation</a>.  Oh my.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a></p><p><em> “Did you read that newsletter?”  </em></p><div class=\"digest-post-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;f993560d-e7b3-4c69-a24a-82c526ee3a7b&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;I got an email from a colleague today asking me what I thought about a “healthcare product.” I figured instead of just a quick email back, I could explain to everybody how I look at new innovations in healthcare, and try to determine if what I’m looking at is real or fake—and this time I’m only going to use the website!&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:null,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;showDescription&quot;:true,&quot;showImage&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;lg&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Rapid Health Scam Detection Guide&quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:2277375,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Owen Scott Muir, M.D&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Dr. Owen Scott Muir is a healthcare innovator and entrepreneur, working across innovative care, payment models, technology, regulatory compliance, and education. He's a graduate of Amherst College.&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1c03f44d-4506-4843-989f-0d38e66c6946_400x400.jpeg&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:null}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2022-10-24T12:00:51.740Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa43b61a4-279a-462b-8ab3-c3218a8e5aaf_1206x1026.jpeg&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/the-rapid-health-scam-detection-guide&quot;,&quot;section_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:80183864,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;reaction_count&quot;:35,&quot;comment_count&quot;:0,&quot;publication_id&quot;:null,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;The Frontier Psychiatrists &quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F997b8496-9b4d-43c2-b393-6f8a77945b00_1080x1080.png&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;youtube_url&quot;:null,&quot;show_links&quot;:null,&quot;feed_url&quot;:null}\"></div><p>I'm not saying this is a scam, but much like our friend Kayne…</p><div id=\"youtube2-6vwNcNOTVzY\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;6vwNcNOTVzY&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/6vwNcNOTVzY?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><p>I was asked to review papers.  <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/how-to-read-academic-research-like?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">Just two days ago, I wrote and article about how to waste less time reading research by using simple Rules like:</a></p><div class=\"pullquote\"><p>“if table one indicates it’s not a successful randomization, you can stop now.”</p></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m1gA!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe9a9cbde-5e51-4010-a407-ed91a8e3f7b0_1200x728.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m1gA!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe9a9cbde-5e51-4010-a407-ed91a8e3f7b0_1200x728.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m1gA!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe9a9cbde-5e51-4010-a407-ed91a8e3f7b0_1200x728.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m1gA!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe9a9cbde-5e51-4010-a407-ed91a8e3f7b0_1200x728.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m1gA!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe9a9cbde-5e51-4010-a407-ed91a8e3f7b0_1200x728.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m1gA!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/http