utton></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Ok.  Phase I data.  I’m not buying a product for my clinic yet.</p><p>What else do you have?  Oh…this is promising…</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zirU!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4bdf2059-0278-48df-91fe-c95bbf5b2d29_846x1200.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zirU!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4bdf2059-0278-48df-91fe-c95bbf5b2d29_846x1200.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zirU!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4bdf2059-0278-48df-91fe-c95bbf5b2d29_846x1200.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zirU!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4bdf2059-0278-48df-91fe-c95bbf5b2d29_846x1200.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zirU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4bdf2059-0278-48df-91fe-c95bbf5b2d29_846x1200.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zirU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4bdf2059-0278-48df-91fe-c95bbf5b2d29_846x1200.jpeg\" width=\"846\" height=\"1200\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4bdf2059-0278-48df-91fe-c95bbf5b2d29_846x1200.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fulls